  "notes": "Waiver filing (Exhibit A, period 10/1/22-9/30/23; accountant's compilation). Total column used (General and Street funds only). Utility spending kept governmental as in the FY2024 report (no separate utility fund column or balance). Transfer 9,000 General to Street (Schedule of Interfund Transfers p3); printed totals include transfers (receipts 575,301 incl. 9,000 in; disbursements 330,260 incl. 9,000 out). Roll-forward 372,382 + 566,301 - 321,260 + 9,000 - 9,000 = 617,423. No investments (Schedule of Investments N/A). Notes payable 892,115 + 57,717 = 949,832 (p3) not on the cash statement. County treasurer balances 1,296 (10/1/22) and 2,178 (9/30/23) printed separately, not in cash. No supplementary schedules; detail is one line per Exhibit A row per fund column. Read pages 1-3 of 3"
